   "summary": "Korea's bourse operator on Friday activated a circuit breaker for the benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) on an extended sell-off in tech shares. Trading of KOSPI-listed shares was halted for 20 minutes from 9:03, as the index plunged more than 8 percent from the previous session's close.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国交易所运营商周五针对科技股持续大幅抛售，为基准的韩国综合股价指数（KOSPI）启动熔断机制。9时03分起，韩国综合股价指数上市股票暂停交易20分钟，此前该指数较前一交易日收盘点位下跌逾8%。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korea's bourse operator on Friday activated a circuit breaker for the benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) on an extended sell-off in tech shares. Trading of KOSPI-listed shares was halted for 20 minutes from 9:03, as the index plunged more than 8 percent from the previous session's close. The benchmark index came under heavy selling pressure following a tech rout on Wall Street, triggered by concerns that Democrats' sweeping victory in the U.S. midterms could slow down the pace of the build out of artificial intelligence (AI) data centers. It marked the tenth time this year that the KRX has activated a circuit breaker",
