   "title": "Lee set for summit with East Timor President Horta on strengthening ties",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261106/lee-set-for-summit-with-east-timor-president-horta-on-strengthening-ties",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
