   "title": "EC announces SSR in 4 states and 2 UTs; draft rolls on Nov 30",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/ec-announces-ssr-in-4-states-and-2-uts-draft-rolls-on-nov-30-101793902543996.html",
