   "title": "Iranian MP tells Euronews Tehran's missiles will strike Europe if US uses its bases there",
   "url": "https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/04/iranian-mp-tells-euronews-tehrans-missiles-will-strike-europe-if-us-uses-its-bases-there",
   "domain": "euronews.com",
