   "title": "Stock markets rally in early trade on foreign fund inflows, easing crude oil prices",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/markets/stock-markets-rally-in-early-trade-on-foreign-fund-inflows-easing-crude-oil-prices/article71664174.ece",
