   "title": "Senior N. Korean party official visiting China: KCNA",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261104/senior-n-korean-party-official-visiting-china-kcna",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
